# Formatting is for the code this repository writes. Everything below is either vendored,
# generated, or gated by a check that reads the bytes literally — reflowing any of it would
# either lose the vendor's history or break the gate that greps it.
lib/
out/
cache/
node_modules/
broadcast/
coverage/

# The published surface is asserted verbatim by script/check-surface.sh, which greps the
# committed file for exact pins and banned phrases. A reformat would move those lines.
web/index.html

# Generated or externally-owned artifacts.
**/generated/
**/build/
**/*.min.js
integrations/graph-v2/tests/.latest.json
package-lock.json

# Foundry owns Solidity formatting via `forge fmt`, which the gate already runs.
*.sol
